§ `Part V - Termination of residential tenancy agreements`

§§ `Division 3 - Special provisions about terminating social housing tenancy agreements`

§§§ `71A. Terms used`

-- Housing Authority, social housing provider, social housing
-- premises and social housing tenancy agreement are facts. Premises
-- excluded by regulation are not social housing premises.

§§§ `71B. Application of Division`

`this Division does not limit the operation of the other provisions of this Part in relation to social housing tenancy agreements` MEANS TRUE

§§§ `71C. Notice of termination by lessor on ground that tenant not eligible for social housing premises`

DECLARE `section 71C notice` HAS
    `the agreement is a social housing tenancy agreement` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the lessor has carried out an assessment under section 71D` IS A BOOLEAN
    `as a result of the assessment the lessor has determined that the tenant is not eligible to reside in social housing premises or in the class of social housing premises to which the agreement relates` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the tenancy is for a fixed term` IS A BOOLEAN
    `months remaining in the fixed term` IS A NUMBER
    `the tenant refused to provide information reasonably required for the assessment` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the lessor has advised the tenant of the decision by notice in writing under section 71F` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the section 71F notice contains particulars of the reasons, states that the tenant may apply for a review within 30 days and that the tenant may make representations` IS A BOOLEAN
    `days after the section 71F notice was given` IS A NUMBER
    `the tenant has applied for a review` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the review has been carried out` IS A BOOLEAN
    `days of notice before vacant possession is required` IS A NUMBER
    `days remaining in the fixed term when vacant possession is required` IS A NUMBER

GIVEN n IS A `section 71C notice`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the assessment under section 71D may be carried out` IF
        n's `the agreement is a social housing tenancy agreement`
    AND (
            NOT n's `the tenancy is for a fixed term`
        OR  n's `months remaining in the fixed term` AT MOST 6
        )

@ref Residential Tenancies Act 1987 (WA) s.71C
@export Decide whether a lessor may give notice of termination on the ground that the tenant is not eligible for social housing premises
GIVEN n IS A `section 71C notice` @desc Social housing agreement. The lessor must have assessed eligibility under s.71D using the s.71E criteria (or determined ineligibility because the tenant refused reasonably required information). For a fixed term, the assessment may not be carried out more than 6 months before the end of the term. Before giving the termination notice the lessor must give the s.71F advice notice, wait 30 days or the end of any review, and give at least 60 days before vacant possession (or, for a fixed term, the later of 60 days and the end of the term).
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the lessor may give notice of termination under section 71C` IF
        n's `the agreement is a social housing tenancy agreement`
    AND `the assessment under section 71D may be carried out` n
    AND n's `as a result of the assessment the lessor has determined that the tenant is not eligible to reside in social housing premises or in the class of social housing premises to which the agreement relates`
    AND n's `the lessor has advised the tenant of the decision by notice in writing under section 71F`
    AND n's `the section 71F notice contains particulars of the reasons, states that the tenant may apply for a review within 30 days and that the tenant may make representations`
    AND (
            (
                NOT n's `the tenant has applied for a review`
            AND n's `days after the section 71F notice was given` AT LEAST 30
            )
        OR  n's `the review has been carried out`
        )
    AND n's `days of notice before vacant possession is required` AT LEAST 60
    AND (
            NOT n's `the tenancy is for a fixed term`
        OR  n's `days remaining in the fixed term when vacant possession is required` AT MOST 0
        )

§§§ `71H. Notice of termination by lessor where tenant offered alternative social housing premises`

DECLARE `section 71H notice` HAS
    `the agreement is a social housing tenancy agreement` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the lessor has offered to enter into a new social housing tenancy agreement with the tenant in respect of alternative premises` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the lessor has advised the tenant of the decision by notice in writing under section 71I` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the section 71I notice contains particulars of the reasons, states that the tenant may apply for a review within 30 days and that the tenant may make representations` IS A BOOLEAN
    `days after the section 71I notice was given` IS A NUMBER
    `the tenant has applied for a review` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the review has been carried out` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the lessor and tenant have entered into a new social housing tenancy agreement` IS A BOOLEAN
    `days of notice before vacant possession is required` IS A NUMBER
    `the tenant has consented to an earlier vacant possession day` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the alternative premises are available for occupation no later than 7 days before the vacant possession day` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the tenancy is for a fixed term` IS A BOOLEAN

@ref Residential Tenancies Act 1987 (WA) s.71H
@export Decide whether a lessor may give notice of termination on the ground that the tenant has been offered alternative social housing premises
GIVEN n IS A `section 71H notice` @desc Social housing agreement. The lessor has offered a new social housing tenancy agreement for alternative premises. Before giving the termination notice the lessor must give the s.71I advice notice and wait 30 days or the end of any review, unless the parties have already entered the new agreement. Vacant possession must be at least 60 days after the notice unless the tenant consents to an earlier day. The notice is ineffective unless the alternative premises are available no later than 7 days before that day.
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the lessor may give notice of termination under section 71H` IF
        n's `the agreement is a social housing tenancy agreement`
    AND n's `the lessor has offered to enter into a new social housing tenancy agreement with the tenant in respect of alternative premises`
    AND n's `the lessor has advised the tenant of the decision by notice in writing under section 71I`
    AND n's `the section 71I notice contains particulars of the reasons, states that the tenant may apply for a review within 30 days and that the tenant may make representations`
    AND (
            n's `the lessor and tenant have entered into a new social housing tenancy agreement`
        OR  (
                NOT n's `the tenant has applied for a review`
            AND n's `days after the section 71I notice was given` AT LEAST 30
            )
        OR  n's `the review has been carried out`
        )
    AND (
            n's `days of notice before vacant possession is required` AT LEAST 60
        OR  n's `the tenant has consented to an earlier vacant possession day`
        )
    AND n's `the alternative premises are available for occupation no later than 7 days before the vacant possession day`

§§ `Fixtures`

`ineligible after review 60 days` MEANS `section 71C notice` WITH
    `the agreement is a social housing tenancy agreement` IS TRUE,
    `the lessor has carried out an assessment under section 71D` IS TRUE,
    `as a result of the assessment the lessor has determined that the tenant is not eligible to reside in social housing premises or in the class of social housing premises to which the agreement relates` IS TRUE,
    `the tenancy is for a fixed term` IS FALSE,
    `months remaining in the fixed term` IS 0,
    `the tenant refused to provide information reasonably required for the assessment` IS FALSE,
    `the lessor has advised the tenant of the decision by notice in writing under section 71F` IS TRUE,
    `the section 71F notice contains particulars of the reasons, states that the tenant may apply for a review within 30 days and that the tenant may make representations` IS TRUE,
    `days after the section 71F notice was given` IS 40,
    `the tenant has applied for a review` IS TRUE,
    `the review has been carried out` IS TRUE,
    `days of notice before vacant possession is required` IS 60,
    `days remaining in the fixed term when vacant possession is required` IS 0

`71C notice given on day 10 of review window` MEANS `section 71C notice` WITH
    `the agreement is a social housing tenancy agreement` IS TRUE,
    `the lessor has carried out an assessment under section 71D` IS TRUE,
    `as a result of the assessment the lessor has determined that the tenant is not eligible to reside in social housing premises or in the class of social housing premises to which the agreement relates` IS TRUE,
    `the tenancy is for a fixed term` IS FALSE,
    `months remaining in the fixed term` IS 0,
    `the tenant refused to provide information reasonably required for the assessment` IS FALSE,
    `the lessor has advised the tenant of the decision by notice in writing under section 71F` IS TRUE,
    `the section 71F notice contains particulars of the reasons, states that the tenant may apply for a review within 30 days and that the tenant may make representations` IS TRUE,
    `days after the section 71F notice was given` IS 10,
    `the tenant has applied for a review` IS FALSE,
    `the review has been carried out` IS FALSE,
    `days of notice before vacant possession is required` IS 60,
    `days remaining in the fixed term when vacant possession is required` IS 0

`alternative premises 60 days available` MEANS `section 71H notice` WITH
    `the agreement is a social housing tenancy agreement` IS TRUE,
    `the lessor has offered to enter into a new social housing tenancy agreement with the tenant in respect of alternative premises` IS TRUE,
    `the lessor has advised the tenant of the decision by notice in writing under section 71I` IS TRUE,
    `the section 71I notice contains particulars of the reasons, states that the tenant may apply for a review within 30 days and that the tenant may make representations` IS TRUE,
    `days after the section 71I notice was given` IS 30,
    `the tenant has applied for a review` IS FALSE,
    `the review has been carried out` IS FALSE,
    `the lessor and tenant have entered into a new social housing tenancy agreement` IS FALSE,
    `days of notice before vacant possession is required` IS 60,
    `the tenant has consented to an earlier vacant possession day` IS FALSE,
    `the alternative premises are available for occupation no later than 7 days before the vacant possession day` IS TRUE,
    `the tenancy is for a fixed term` IS FALSE

`alternative premises not available` MEANS `section 71H notice` WITH
    `the agreement is a social housing tenancy agreement` IS TRUE,
    `the lessor has offered to enter into a new social housing tenancy agreement with the tenant in respect of alternative premises` IS TRUE,
    `the lessor has advised the tenant of the decision by notice in writing under section 71I` IS TRUE,
    `the section 71I notice contains particulars of the reasons, states that the tenant may apply for a review within 30 days and that the tenant may make representations` IS TRUE,
    `days after the section 71I notice was given` IS 30,
    `the tenant has applied for a review` IS FALSE,
    `the review has been carried out` IS FALSE,
    `the lessor and tenant have entered into a new social housing tenancy agreement` IS FALSE,
    `days of notice before vacant possession is required` IS 60,
    `the tenant has consented to an earlier vacant possession day` IS FALSE,
    `the alternative premises are available for occupation no later than 7 days before the vacant possession day` IS FALSE,
    `the tenancy is for a fixed term` IS FALSE

#EVAL `the lessor may give notice of termination under section 71C` `ineligible after review 60 days`
#EVAL `the lessor may give notice of termination under section 71C` `71C notice given on day 10 of review window`
#EVAL `the lessor may give notice of termination under section 71H` `alternative premises 60 days available`
#EVAL `the lessor may give notice of termination under section 71H` `alternative premises not available`
#ASSERT `the lessor may give notice of termination under section 71C` `ineligible after review 60 days` EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `the lessor may give notice of termination under section 71C` `71C notice given on day 10 of review window` EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `the lessor may give notice of termination under section 71H` `alternative premises 60 days available` EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `the lessor may give notice of termination under section 71H` `alternative premises not available` EQUALS FALSE
